{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/2c24318d27043798edd3b06aad78bd26.webp?t=1772034489\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Plan B4?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I run a private company. You wouldn\u2019t find it on the books, or in any honest conversation.<br>We take contracts no one else will: assassinations, sabotage, bomb planting\u2026 and occasionally bomb <i>defusal</i> for the same client.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You? You\u2019re my new asset.<br>You\u2019ll work for me until your debt is paid, or your body isn\u2019t. Whichever comes first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/be387fc220a64dfead6b33b8ecc55296.poster.avif?t=1772034489\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/be387fc220a64dfead6b33b8ecc55296.webm?t=1772034489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/be387fc220a64dfead6b33b8ecc55296.mp4?t=1772034489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Ways to Earn Your Keep</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Mode \u2013 Co-op Chaos</strong> <i>(Hotline Miami, but you bring a friend)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suit up with your friends and dive into fast, bloody, ridiculous missions across the world.<br>Kick down doors, clear rooms, and try not to shoot each other in the back.<br>I\u2019ll feed you contracts, intel, and the occasional insult. You\u2019ll either love me or hate me, both are fine :)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online 4-player co-op</strong>: Your friends are either your lifeline or your liability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission-based carnage</strong>: From prison riots to corporate sabotage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A shady conspiracy</strong>: No, you don\u2019t get to know the whole plan. Yet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/38247a399fb4ddb06ec626ff77a6f02d.poster.avif?t=1772034489\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/38247a399fb4ddb06ec626ff77a6f02d.webm?t=1772034489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/38247a399fb4ddb06ec626ff77a6f02d.mp4?t=1772034489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Competitive Mode \u2013 Bombs, Bullets, and Bad Decisions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and a bunch of other assets will split into two teams:<br>One plants the bomb, the other defuses it.<br>Simple. Clean. Profitable for me either way.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant Team</strong> \u2013 Get in, plant the package, protect it until it blows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defuse Team</strong> \u2013 Stop them. Cut the right wire. Don\u2019t cut your own fingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, tactical maps designed for maximum tension (and maximum shouting at your friends).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round is a fresh chance to redeem yourself\u2026 or to be the reason your team loses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/2c24318d27043798edd3b06aad78bd26.webp?t=1772034489\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Keep Playing?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because I said so.<br>And because you\u2019ll unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bases to decorate <i>and</i> weaponize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to raid other players\u2019 bases, just to prove you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons, more gadgets, more bad decisions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/f9105f4e8c8ba71784d0b734df94829a.poster.avif?t=1772034489\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/f9105f4e8c8ba71784d0b734df94829a.webm?t=1772034489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/f9105f4e8c8ba71784d0b734df94829a.mp4?t=1772034489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You\u2019re in my company now.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proceed with the Plan A.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, and we move to Plan B4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail that\u2026 we\u2019ll just reuse your codename for the next recruit.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3423700?t=1772034489","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772034489","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/85db842e54bb67ee0f129c02c58baa06ca27924a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772034489","capsule_imagev5":"